# The build context for both Rust images is the repo root, because a workspace member outside
# the context is invisible to the build and `api` and `worker` share apps/common. That means
# everything large in the tree would otherwise be uploaded to the daemon on every build.
#
# apps/web still builds from apps/web with its own .dockerignore, so nothing here affects it.
.git
.github
k8s
target
apps/*/target
node_modules
apps/*/node_modules
apps/web/dist
.env
